      "id": "u1",
      "kind": "CONCEPT",
      "label": "Introduction and list of Group 2 alkaline earth metal elements",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "नमस्ते! आज हम periodic table के **Group 2** के तत्वों के बारे में पढ़ेंगे, जिन्हें **क्षारीय मृदा धातुएँ (Alkaline Earth Metals)** कहते हैं।\n\n## तत्वों की सूची\n\nइस समूह में 6 तत्व आते हैं:\n\n| तत्व | संकेत |\n|------|-------|\n| Beryllium | Be |\n| Magnesium | Mg |\n| Calcium | Ca |\n| Strontium | Sr |\n| Barium | Ba |\n| Radium | Ra |",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "depth": "statement"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "Correctly defines Group 2 elements as alkaline earth metals and accurately lists all six members with their chemical symbols.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u2",
      "kind": "CONCEPT",
      "label": "Etymology and origin of the name alkaline earth metals",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "## नाम \"क्षारीय मृदा धातु\" क्यों?\n\n- ये धातुएँ **मिट्टी (earth)** में यौगिकों के रूप में पाई जाती हैं (जैसे चूना पत्थर, चाक)\n- इनके ऑक्साइड **क्षारीय (alkaline)** प्रकृति के होते हैं, यानी पानी में घुलने पर **base** बनाते हैं\n\nइसलिए इन्हें \"Alkaline Earth Metals\" कहा जाता है।",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "depth": "explanation"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "Accurately explains the historical origin of the name based on occurrence in earth/minerals and basic oxide properties.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u3",
      "kind": "CONCEPT",
      "label": "General valence electronic configuration of alkaline earth metals",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "## इलेक्ट्रॉनिक विन्यास\n\nइन सभी तत्वों के बाहरी कोश (outermost shell) में **2 इलेक्ट्रॉन** होते हैं:\n\n$$ns^2$$\n\nउदाहरण: Calcium (Ca) = [Ar] 4s²",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "depth": "statement"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "Correctly states the general valence shell configuration as ns² and provides the correct configuration for calcium.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u4",
      "kind": "CONCEPT",
      "label": "Metallic lustre and appearance of alkaline earth metals",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "### 1. **धात्विक चमक**\nये चमकदार, चांदी जैसी सफेद धातुएँ होती हैं।",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "depth": "statement"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "Accurately describes the silvery-white lustrous appearance characteristic of alkaline earth metals.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u5",
      "kind": "CONCEPT",
      "label": "Valency and divalent cation formation",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "### 2. **संयोजकता (Valency)**\nइनकी संयोजकता **+2** होती है, क्योंकि ये 2 इलेक्ट्रॉन आसानी से त्याग देते हैं:\n$$M \\rightarrow M^{2+} + 2e^-$$",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "depth": "explanation"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "Correctly explains that alkaline earth metals have a valency of +2 due to the loss of their two valence electrons to form dipositive cations.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u6",
      "kind": "CONCEPT",
      "label": "Chemical reactivity and downward group trend",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "### 3. **अभिक्रियाशीलता (Reactivity)**\n- Group 1 (alkali metals) से कम क्रियाशील होती हैं\n- लेकिन फिर भी काफी reactive होती हैं\n- नीचे जाने पर (Be से Ra तक) क्रियाशीलता **बढ़ती** है",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "depth": "statement"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "Accurately compares reactivity to Group 1 alkali metals and states the increasing trend down the group.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u7",
      "kind": "CONCEPT",
      "label": "Atomic size trend down the group",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "### 4. **परमाणु आकार (Atomic Size)**\nऊपर से नीचे जाने पर परमाणु का आकार **बढ़ता** है (नया shell जुड़ने के कारण)",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
